### Root of the OL state.
###
### The protocol state root that block headers, checkpoints, and genesis commit
### to is the hash tree root of this container, over exactly these three fields.
### Its layout never changes; a new chainstate layout changes only what
### `chainstate_root` commits to.
###
### The version fields are raw `uint32` values rather than the `uint8` encoding
### of `OLSpecId`, so that a root naming a spec this binary does not know still
### decodes and can be reported.
class OLRootState(Container):
    ### Spec the chainstate was produced under.
    ###
    ### Selects the chainstate layout through the spec-to-layout mapping.
    cur_spec_version: uint32

    ### Spec the next epoch runs under.
    ###
    ### Equal to `cur_spec_version` except between the terminal block of an
    ### epoch that processes a checkpoint predicate enactment and the first
    ### block of the next epoch.
    staged_spec_version: uint32

    ### Hash tree root of the chainstate in the layout `cur_spec_version` maps to.
    chainstate_root: Bytes32
